[[File:Language settings.png|thumb|253x253px|The language settings in ''[[Java Edition]]''.]]
[[File:Ore UI - Settings Screen Menu "Language" Tab (Bedrock).png|thumb|The language settings in ''[[Bedrock Edition]]''.]]
The '''language''' menu, accessible in [[options]]{{only|JE|short=1}} or [[settings]]{{only|BE|short=1}}, enables the selection of languages outside of the system default. Most of these languages are real; however, some ''Java Edition''-exclusive languages, such as LOLCAT and Shakespearean English, are intended as jokes.

== Languages ==
{{hatnote|1=Note: Languages with a <span style{{=}}"background-color: #ddd;">gray background</span> are "joke" languages.}}

